      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "We aim to be on-site within 2-4 hours for emergencies inside our primary service area — Auburn Township, Pepper Pike, Chagrin Falls, Moreland Hills, Solon, and the surrounding inner-ring suburbs. After-hours and weekend response carries a 50% surcharge over scheduled rates. Tier 2 and Tier 3 markets receive priority but may have slightly longer mobilization." }
    },
